# システム環境設定's 〈電源管理〉 on the x64 PC (design 3.10.6, 11.6), for tools/x64/ui_run64.py
# with UI_EXTRA="-acpitable file=acpi_battery.aml" (tools/x64/tests/acpi_battery.asl):
# the AC adapter and the battery are read from their device objects, and read again as
# they tell of a change. The test table plugs the adapter in or out each fifth time the
# battery's _BST is read and notifies it (0x80), as a machine's firmware does; the kernel
# reads the battery every 30 seconds, so the adapter changes every two minutes or so.
# The window is at 160,80: the tab 電源管理 at 282,151. Ctrl+E closes.
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
expect sysenv: ready
expect sysenv: power
wait 800
win システム環境設定
click 282 151
wait 500
shot sp_first
# the adapter out: told by its object, shown without the page being touched
logmark
expectsincein 330 sysenv: power バッテリ /
wait 500
shot sp_battery
# and in again
logmark
expectsincein 330 sysenv: power ＡＣ電源 /
wait 500
shot sp_ac
key 08 01
expect sysenv: closed
